OL,3,GNEWSANew pictures released ahead of The
OL,4,AOther Bennet Sister Christmas special
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew images have been revealed ahead of
OL,7,Fthe Christmas special of BBC series The
OL,8,FOther Bennet Sister.
OL,10,FInspired by Jane Austen's Pride and
OL,11,FPrejudice, the first series was filmed
OL,12,Flargely in Wales and attracted 6.5
OL,13,Fmillion UK viewers in its first 28
OL,14,Fdays.
OL,16,FThe series finale saw Mary Bennet,
OL,17,Fplayed by Ella Bruccoleri, agree to
OL,18,Fmarry Tom Hayward, played by Donal
OL,19,FFinn.
OL,21,FFilming wrapped on the three-part
OL,22,FChristmas special at the end of August.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
